    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Attractive end-of-terrace bungalow in a private purpose-built retirement complex, located in Beechfield Manor,  c.200m to the north of Shankill Village, off Shanganagh Road. Within easy reach of Shankill Village, Shopping Centre, churches, and the beach. Multiple bus-routes & Shankill DART station is c. 500m. Floor area of c. 57.60 sq.m. / 620 sq.ft. Accommodation includes entrance lobby, lounge, separate kitchen, two bedrooms and bathroom. Double-glazed uPVC windows. Electric storage & convector heating. Communal gardens & communal parking. Over 50s only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE LOBBY\t\r\n\r\nLOUNGE\t5.22M X 4.09M with open fireplace. Includes entrance lobby.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN\t2.46M X 2.24M with fitted wall & floor units.  \r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 1\t3.30M X 2.76 M  with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 2\t4.37M X 2.23M with built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBATHROOM\t1.68M X 3.38M   With walk-in shower cubicle.  Electric pump shower."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Rare bungalow type, one of four in the overall complex.\r\n - 1990-built\r\n - communal parking outside the property\r\n - uPVC double-glazed windows\r\n - Fireplace in the lounge\r\n - over 50s retirement village"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "At Shankill Village, travel northbound to roundabout.  Take third exit onto Corbawn Lane. At roundabout, take first exit.  Take first turn to right here, into Beechfield Haven through granite entrance pillars.  Continue along driveway here, into upper car park of Maryland.  No. 11 is last bungalow in row of four bungalows."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "By prior appointment with Sole Agent."
      }
    ],
